# Generated lore universes — never committed.
# `import-lore-json.js` writes one module per lore compendium (plus an `index.ts`
# barrel carrying an `importedUniverses` array). The compendia live under the kb's
# private `lore/` root and this repo is public, so the generated modules stay local
# and git-ignored. `UniverseRegistry` loads that barrel at runtime when it is
# present (james-gibson/local-time#98), so a synced universe is registered without
# ever being committed.
src/config/universes/imported/
.env.production.local

